# ── YouTube → MP3 Serverless Function ────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy these into Vercel: Settings → Environment Variables
#
# 1. Go to https://rapidapi.com and subscribe to a YouTube-to-MP3 API
#    (e.g. "YouTube to MP3" by youtube-mp36 on RapidAPI)
# 2. Copy your API key from RapidAPI → Apps → Application Credentials
# 3. In Vercel, add the following environment variables:

RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here
RAPIDAPI_HOST=youtube-mp36.p.rapidapi.com

# Optional: override the endpoint URL if your RapidAPI provider uses a
# different path (defaults to https://youtube-mp36.p.rapidapi.com/dl)
# RAPIDAPI_ENDPOINT=https://your-provider.p.rapidapi.com/dl
